  "Tally is Locked": "Tally 已锁定",
  "Tally is built only with Apple frameworks: SwiftUI, SwiftData, Swift Charts, LocalAuthentication, CryptoKit and Security. No third-party code is included in the app.": "Tally 仅使用 Apple 框架构建：SwiftUI、SwiftData、Swift Charts、LocalAuthentication、CryptoKit 和 Security。App 中不含第三方代码。",
  "Tally keeps all data on this iPhone. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you export it or choose to download exchange rates.": "Tally 的所有数据都保存在这台 iPhone 上。除非你导出数据或主动下载汇率，否则不会发送任何内容。",
  "Tally records balance adjustments, deletions, imports and restores so changes to your money can be traced.": "Tally 会记录余额调整、删除、导入和恢复，让资金变动可以追溯。",
  "Tally tracks it in real time and lets you know gently when you get close.": "Tally 会实时追踪，并在接近额度时温和提醒。",
  "Tap + to record your first expense or income.": "轻点 + 记录第一笔支出或收入。",
