  "The balance at the start of this day. Transactions dated earlier still appear in reports but don't change the balance.": "这一天开始时的余额。更早日期的交易仍会出现在统计中，但不改变余额。",
  "The currency can't change once transactions exist, so past amounts stay correct.": "账户已有交易后无法更改币种，以确保历史金额准确。",
  "The discount can't be negative or more than the amount.": "折扣不能为负数，也不能大于金额。",
